acceptance_criteria: "Use the pinned public SDK global-option contract and refuse ambiguous resolution; Real source and built HTTP collision acceptance returns 409 with no execution marker and unchanged settings for both separate-value cases; Cover equals forms, nested flag positions, booleans and terminators while preserving owned commands; Behavioral helper revert fails after rebuilding and both release gates pass at unchanged thresholds; Allow harmless local option values when all candidate owned command prefixes belong to the selected package, while refusing candidate collisions and retaining existing global normalization and terminator handling; Reverting only the new candidate-path logic to the PR baseline and rebuilding makes both source and built allowed-value HTTP acceptance fail"
resolution: "Reverified main ca7e188bc91e (unchanged since audit): [PR #192](https://github.com/unbraind/pm-web/pull/192) (16aa6cd) normalizes separate-value global flags before command-ownership checks and adds collisions regression coverage. Retained evidence: src/services/pm-runner.ts, test/catalog-install-e2e.test.ts."
