  "2026-10-12T12:40:02.146Z",codex-sol,"Final verification: bun run release:check passed unchanged with the required fleet root, fresh HOME and disabled global/system Git configuration: 575/575 tests, zero failures/skips/cancellations/todo, all 34 configured server sources, statements/lines 90.57%, branches 80.61%, functions 93.45%, unchanged 90/90/79/92 thresholds, zero duplication and production vulnerabilities, 4/4 packed current/minimum npm/native-Bun scenarios, changelog/date/attestation checks. Both release gates produce tarball SHA-1 87df9a8b9a235cbe795e49c411a2b6ecbf81f729. Focused and PM-linked acceptance pass 3/3. Baseline-function revert fails both source and built allowed-value cases (1 pass, 2 failures). Dist rebuilt; documentation updated. No new PM CLI/SDK defect observed; linked-result tracking is disabled, so results are recorded in these comments. Ready for orchestrator verification on existing PR https://github.com/unbraind/pm-web/pull/192; item remains in_progress and will not be closed."
